    "detailed_description": "<h1>DOWNLOAD THE SUNDERFOLK FREE TRIAL</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the first four missions of Sunderfolk for free! Test your skills in tactical encounters, try out the phone controller mechanic, and begin your adventure with the full roster of unique heroes. Best of all, your progress carries over seamlessly when you purchase the full game.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rediscover game night with Sunderfolk, a tactical co-op RPG built to bring people together. Play a shared adventure where your phone becomes your guidebook, controller*, and player sheet. One copy is all you need for your whole party! Whether on the couch, across the world, or huddled around a laptop\u2014it\u2019s your party, your plan, and your story to tell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*The free mobile app is required to play the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One Copy. Everyone Plays.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only one player needs to own the game. Friends join for free using their phones or tablets\u2014no accounts or extra copies needed! Scan a QR code on a shared screen to jump right in. It\u2019s the easiest way to start an adventure together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414270/extras/d5a1f3d6a4fafcd8c48540d25de35aa5.poster.avif?t=1753485177\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414270/extras/d5a1f3d6a4fafcd8c48540d25de35aa5.webm?t=1753485177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Prep Less. Play More.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The free Sunderfolk Controller App becomes your hand of cards, guidebook, and controller. Everyone has exactly what they need to play. No setup, no crowding one screen, and no rules to memorize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414270/extras/0c4cd4e6dd57a6c2f3faf4948d5e46d3.poster.avif?t=1753485177\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414270/extras/0c4cd4e6dd57a6c2f3faf4948d5e46d3.webm?t=1753485177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Your Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Host a couch session, play remotely through Discord, or take it solo by controlling multiple heroes on your own. Sunderfolk bolsters your group, your setup, and your play style to make any night a great game night!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414270/extras/e07be98ca9a61a82e276929343c519e8.poster.avif?t=1753485177\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414270/extras/e07be98ca9a61a82e276929343c519e8.webm?t=1753485177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Start Your Adventure\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your campaign and take on challenging missions together. Use powerful skill cards, choose your turn order, and plan every move. Outsmart enemies, adapt your tactics, and face down epic bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414270/extras/9e0edeef2145bcfe2821c146b6d6f8f1.poster.avif?t=1753485177\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414270/extras/9e0edeef2145bcfe2821c146b6d6f8f1.webm?t=1753485177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find Rest in Arden</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between battles, unwind in the charming village of Arden. Upgrade shops, discover gear, share hearty meals, and connect with locals\u2014some of whom may spark something more than friendship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414270/extras/64ea32fcdd8eb5abd50eb14d1a7db5cf.poster.avif?t=1753485177\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414270/extras/64ea32fcdd8eb5abd50eb14d1a7db5cf.webm?t=1753485177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > The Magic of Game Night, Reimagined\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The magic of gathering around the table, without the setup. Sunderfolk brings friends and families together through thoughtful strategy and shared laughs. With phones as your guides and one copy for all, it\u2019s game night the way you remember it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414270/extras/7f6d2e6b17a5e6fc45d13b31edc79946.poster.avif?t=1753485177\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414270/extras/7f6d2e6b17a5e6fc45d13b31edc79946.webm?t=1753485177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
